{"sentences":[{"id":"s_work_hdnk_52_1","chapterId":"ch_work_hdnk_52","text":"刺禁論篇第五十二","sortOrder":1},{"id":"s_work_hdnk_52_2","chapterId":"ch_work_hdnk_52","text":"黃帝問曰：願聞禁數？","sortOrder":2},{"id":"s_work_hdnk_52_3","chapterId":"ch_work_hdnk_52","text":"岐伯對曰：臟有要害，不可不察。肝生於左，肺藏於右，心部於表，腎治於衳，脾為之使，胃為之市。","sortOrder":3},{"id":"s_work_hdnk_52_4","chapterId":"ch_work_hdnk_52","text":"膈肓之上，中有父母，七節之傍，中有小心，從之有福，逆之有咎。","sortOrder":4},{"id":"s_work_hdnk_52_5","chapterId":"ch_work_hdnk_52","text":"刺中心，一日死。其動為噫。","sortOrder":5},{"id":"s_work_hdnk_52_6","chapterId":"ch_work_hdnk_52","text":"刺中肝，五日死。其動為語。","sortOrder":6},{"id":"s_work_hdnk_52_7","chapterId":"ch_work_hdnk_52","text":"刺中腎，六日死。其動為嚏。","sortOrder":7},{"id":"s_work_hdnk_52_8","chapterId":"ch_work_hdnk_52","text":"刺中肺，三日死。其動為咳。","sortOrder":8},{"id":"s_work_hdnk_52_9","chapterId":"ch_work_hdnk_52","text":"刺中脾，十日死。其動為吞。","sortOrder":9},{"id":"s_work_hdnk_52_10","chapterId":"ch_work_hdnk_52","text":"刺中膽，一日半死。其動為嘔。","sortOrder":10},{"id":"s_work_hdnk_52_11","chapterId":"ch_work_hdnk_52","text":"刺跗上中大脈血出不止死。","sortOrder":11},{"id":"s_work_hdnk_52_12","chapterId":"ch_work_hdnk_52","text":"刺面中溜脈，不幸為盲。","sortOrder":12},{"id":"s_work_hdnk_52_13","chapterId":"ch_work_hdnk_52","text":"刺頭中腦戶，入腦立死。","sortOrder":13},{"id":"s_work_hdnk_52_14","chapterId":"ch_work_hdnk_52","text":"刺舌下中脈太過，血出不止為喑。","sortOrder":14},{"id":"s_work_hdnk_52_15","chapterId":"ch_work_hdnk_52","text":"刺足下佈絡中脈，血不出為腫。","sortOrder":15},{"id":"s_work_hdnk_52_16","chapterId":"ch_work_hdnk_52","text":"刺郗中大脈，令人仆脫色。","sortOrder":16},{"id":"s_work_hdnk_52_17","chapterId":"ch_work_hdnk_52","text":"刺氣街中脈，血不出，為腫鼠仆。","sortOrder":17},{"id":"s_work_hdnk_52_18","chapterId":"ch_work_hdnk_52","text":"刺脊間中髓為傴。","sortOrder":18},{"id":"s_work_hdnk_52_19","chapterId":"ch_work_hdnk_52","text":"刺乳上，中乳房，為腫根蝕。","sortOrder":19},{"id":"s_work_hdnk_52_20","chapterId":"ch_work_hdnk_52","text":"刺缺盆中內陷氣泄，令人喘咳逆。","sortOrder":20},{"id":"s_work_hdnk_52_21","chapterId":"ch_work_hdnk_52","text":"刺手魚腹內陷為腫。","sortOrder":21},{"id":"s_work_hdnk_52_22","chapterId":"ch_work_hdnk_52","text":"無刺大醉，令人氣亂；無刺大怒，令人氣逆：無刺大勞人；無刺新飽人；無刺大飢人；無刺大渴人；無刺大驚人。","sortOrder":22},{"id":"s_work_hdnk_52_23","chapterId":"ch_work_hdnk_52","text":"刺陰股中大脈，血出不止，死。","sortOrder":23},{"id":"s_work_hdnk_52_24","chapterId":"ch_work_hdnk_52","text":"刺客主人內陷中脈，為內漏為聾。","sortOrder":24},{"id":"s_work_hdnk_52_25","chapterId":"ch_work_hdnk_52","text":"刺膝臏出液為跛。","sortOrder":25},{"id":"s_work_hdnk_52_26","chapterId":"ch_work_hdnk_52","text":"刺臂太陰脈，出血多，立死。","sortOrder":26},{"id":"s_work_hdnk_52_27","chapterId":"ch_work_hdnk_52","text":"刺足少陰脈，重虛出血，為舌難以言。","sortOrder":27},{"id":"s_work_hdnk_52_28","chapterId":"ch_work_hdnk_52","text":"刺膺中陷中，肺為喘逆仰息。","sortOrder":28},{"id":"s_work_hdnk_52_29","chapterId":"ch_work_hdnk_52","text":"刺肘中內陷氣歸之，為之不屈伸。","sortOrder":29},{"id":"s_work_hdnk_52_30","chapterId":"ch_work_hdnk_52","text":"刺陰股下三寸內陷，令人遺溺。","sortOrder":30},{"id":"s_work_hdnk_52_31","chapterId":"ch_work_hdnk_52","text":"刺腋下脅間內陷，令人咳。","sortOrder":31},{"id":"s_work_hdnk_52_32","chapterId":"ch_work_hdnk_52","text":"刺少腹中膀胱溺出，令人少腹滿。","sortOrder":32},{"id":"s_work_hdnk_52_33","chapterId":"ch_work_hdnk_52","text":"刺腨腸內陷為腫。","sortOrder":33},{"id":"s_work_hdnk_52_34","chapterId":"ch_work_hdnk_52","text":"刺眶上陷骨中脈，為漏為盲。","sortOrder":34},{"id":"s_work_hdnk_52_35","chapterId":"ch_work_hdnk_52","text":"刺關節中液出，不得屈伸。","sortOrder":35}],"overrides":{}}